==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|0|1|2|núll|tveir|ord=fyrstur}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|einn}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*ainaz}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*óynos}}. Compare Faroese and Norwegian Nynorsk {{m|fo|ein}}, Danish, Swedish, and Norwegian Bokmål {{m|da|en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/eitn/|lang=is}}

===Numeral===
'''einn''' {{g|m}}, '''[[ein]]''' {{g|f}}, '''[[eitt]]''' {{g|n}}

# [[one]]; the cardinal number after {{m|is|núll||zero}} and before {{m|is|tveir||two}}.
# accusative masculine singular form of [[einn#Icelandic|einn]]

